//! The console stall key `off`, the default: the console counts nothing.
//!
//! One of the `s3stall` modules, mapped by a case's `console_stall` (the
//! runner) or an image's `[keys]` (`sosimage`). The HAL calls the functions
//! below only behind `CONSOLE_STALL_COUNT`, which folds every call away here,
//! so they are empty (`../../kernel/lib.saw`, `console_byte` and `exit_pass`;
//! `../stall-on/lib.saw` is the count).

/// Whether the console measures how long the kernel waits for FIFO room.
public static CONSOLE_STALL_COUNT: Bool = false

public func counted_byte(b: UInt8) unsafe { }

public func report_stall() unsafe { }
